# Packages preinstalled into the LMDesktopPlus FreeBSD install image.
# Fed to `poudriere image -f` (one package per line, '#' comments ignored).
#
# The desktop metaport pulls the full vapor//matrix peer set + the control
# center from the local poudriere repo (see packaging/freebsd/poudriere/):
lmdesktopplus-desktop
# X server + session launcher (not a UI RUN_DEPEND, but needed to display it):
xorg
xinit
# Desktop integration bus:
dbus
# Wallpaper setter used by the vapor//matrix .xinitrc:
feh
